                <pb facs="0261" n="155" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg155"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hicks to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-08-19">August 19,
                        1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hicks reports 30 deaths in Santiago and much destruction of property,
                    Valparaiso reported 500 deaths and immense destruction by fire; many other towns
                    wiped out. He states there is universal mourning.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
